
Given an integer n. You need to recreate the pattern given below for any value of N. Let's say for N = 5, the pattern should look like as below:



    *
   ***
  *****
 *******
*********

------------------------
class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int n = 5;

        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {

            for (int j = 1; j <= 2*n - 1; j++) {

                if (j >= n - i + 1 && j <= n + i - 1) {
                    System.out.print("*");
                } else {
                    System.out.print(" ");
                }

            }

            System.out.println();
        }
    }
}
